## ✅ My Recommendation (for you)

Since you’re starting (site(s) without much traffic yet), here’s how I’d proceed:

1. **Sign up with Awin and/or Webgains** — they are reputable and widely used in the UK/Europe; you get good coverage and “official” product feeds.
2. **Use an aggregator like Feeds4.com or FMTC Datafeed** — to get more variety and many merchants at once, which helps you build content quickly across multiple niches if you plan to build several sites.
3. **Use a CMS + plugin** (e.g. Datafeedr / WooCommerce, or similar) — this avoids building a custom system from scratch and lets you focus on content & layout.
4. **Always add unique content around feed items** — e.g. your own buying guides, reviews, commentary — that will help differentiate your site and give real value to visitors.

